Implemented the dashboard zero-state change in [src/app/pp/page.tsx](/Users/moltbot/pp-agent-work/factory-idea-050/src/app/pp/page.tsx).

The `Shipped Today` card now:
- keeps the existing `approved · denied` hint when `shippedToday > 0`
- shows `Last shipped: X ago` when `shippedToday === 0` and there is a prior approved/denied/redeemed request
- shows `No deploys yet — connect a repo to get started` with a link to `/pp/repos` when there have been no requests at all
- falls back to `Awaiting first decision` if requests exist but none have been approved or denied yet

I left the stats API untouched and did not change the other dashboard cards. Verification: `npm run lint -- --file src/app/pp/page.tsx` passed. `npx tsc --noEmit` fails in this repo due to many pre-existing unrelated type errors outside this change.

